00:38:37,320 --> 00:38:45,760
After centuries of angling invention, the tackle box has undergone some radical changes in shape, size, and content.

473
00:38:46,480 --> 00:38:53,680
My first box was a little bitty metal tackle box that you could almost put in a big pocket.

474
00:38:54,060 --> 00:38:57,420
You look at tackle boxes today, a circus dog couldn't jump over them.

475
00:38:58,800 --> 00:39:01,860
In the old days, you'd load your tackle box into your boat.

476
00:39:03,360 --> 00:39:05,640
Today, your tackle box is the boat.

477
00:39:07,320 --> 00:39:14,420
Today's floating tackle box is powered by a foot-controlled motor that inches it along

478
00:39:14,421 --> 00:39:19,080
