481
00:39:31,481 --> 00:39:35,000
The depth finders today, they're so advanced.

482
00:39:35,001 --> 00:39:42,000
They not only tell you the depth of water that you're in, they'll help you pinpoint ideal structural features.

483
00:39:44,000 --> 00:39:50,000
As each gear brings a new boatload of cool high-tech toys, a question arises.

484
00:39:50,001 --> 00:39:52,000
Can a fisherman have enough tackle?

485
00:39:52,001 --> 00:39:57,000
Oh, you never have enough tackle. You always need gear.

486
00:39:57,001 --> 00:40:00,000
You will never have enough tackle. There's always another rod, another reel.

487
00:40:00,001 --> 00:40:04,240
reel probably about a half a million dollars worth of tackle i have probably 500 rods and

488
00:40:04,241 --> 00:40:12,240
500 reels and 10 000 lures and 10 000 or a million hooks and sinkers still some anglers are able to

489
00:40:12,241 --> 00:40:19,200
resist the high-tech blitz and maintain a more laid-back approach relaxing to come out here on

490
00:40:19,201 --> 00:40:25,920
a saturday or sunday morning and i do it probably just about every week the only thing that happens

491
00:40:25,921 --> 00:40:31,120
because to me sometimes when I get a fish, I really don't know where I'm going to land.

492
00:40:32,660 --> 00:40:37,300
Similar like right now, I'm talking to you guys and I don't know where in the heck I am.

