499
00:41:09,820 --> 00:41:10,520
Sure.

500
00:41:11,140 --> 00:41:13,000
But you might have to wait a few years.

501
00:41:13,860 --> 00:41:18,220
Over the last few decades, antique fishing tackle has become very popular with collectors.

502
00:41:19,700 --> 00:41:22,580
I'm fortunate enough to have Clark Gable's tackle box,

503
00:41:22,581 --> 00:41:26,680
