00:41:32,240 --> 00:41:39,400
Tackle boxes got very elaborate as fishing continued to become popular and expand.

506
00:41:40,300 --> 00:41:45,200
Several years ago, the service repairman had acquired a tackle box

507
00:41:45,201 --> 00:41:48,160
