00:41:48,340 --> 00:41:50,940
He sent me pictures of what's inside the tackle box.

509
00:41:50,941 --> 00:41:55,760
And my knees honestly went weak when I looked at those pictures.

510
00:41:55,920 --> 00:41:58,320
They were lures I'd wanted for my collection forever.

